<title>USA: Pioneer-Standard unit to help resellers.</title>
<headline>Pioneer-Standard unit to help resellers.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pioneer-Standard Electronics Inc on Tuesday said it set up a computer system to provide products and services to resellers.</p>
<p>The company, which distributes computer products and industrial electronic components, said in a statement that KeyLink Systems would help its so-called &quot;value-added resellers&quot; expand their business.</p>
</text>
